<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><div style=""><font face="arial">Dear [<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Client</span>]<br><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Your partnership with Insperity grants access to the <a href="https://portalapps.insperity.com/3rdPartyTraining/skillport.aspx">Insperity Learning Portal</a> which houses books, self-paced trainings, and other professional development opportunities. Your employees have access to this platform at no additional charge. Our learning and development solutions are designed to meet the wide range of challenges facing today's small businesses. Our online course library is broad enough to support specific business goals, while also providing individual skill development. Please feel welcome to share the attached flyer with your employees to give an overview of some of the available content across multiple delivery modes, as well as the sample below.<br><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">You are welcome to disseminate the below email to your employees as appropriate to remind them of the resources available to them.&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Please always feel welcome to reach out to me with any questions.&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">[signature]<br><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Dear [<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Team Members</span>]&nbsp;<br><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">We are excited to remind you that through our Insperity relationship you have access to an array of training and development resources.&nbsp; We encourage you to leverage the access to the professional development opportunities available to you at no charge.<br><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">These trainings can be found on Insperity Premier by navigating to the <a href="https://portalapps.insperity.com/3rdPartyTraining/skillport.aspx">Learning Portal</a>.&nbsp;<br><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><b>The Learning Portal supports various learning needs:</b></font></div><div style=""><ul><li><font face="arial">Leader development</font></li><li><font face="arial">Employee development</font></li><li><font face="arial">Personal wellbeing</font></li><li><font face="arial">Working remote</font></li><li><font face="arial">Microsoft Office suite and other software</font></li><li><font face="arial">Select IT and Business certification prep courses</font></li><li><font face="arial">Environmental, Safety &amp; Health, including OSHA compliance</font></li><li><font face="arial">Legal compliance</font></li></ul></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><b>Resources are available for multiple learning styles:</b>&nbsp; &nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><ul><li><font face="arial">Self-paced courses</font></li><li><font face="arial">Instructor-led virtual training available for registration</font></li><li><font face="arial">Videos</font></li><li><font face="arial">Book Summaries</font></li><li><font face="arial">Articles</font></li></ul></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><b>Manager Administrator Options</b></font></div><div style=""><ul><li><font face="arial">View employee transcripts</font></li><li><font face="arial">Enroll employees in courses</font></li><li><font face="arial">Create and assign curriculum for groups of courses</font></li><li><font face="arial">Run reports</font></li></ul></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><b>Get started&nbsp;</b><br><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Log in at <u>elearning.insperity.com</u> and enter your Insperity(R) Premier login information.&nbsp;<br><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Please reach out to the Insperity Contact Center at 866.715.3552, 7 a.m. - 7 p.m. CT&nbsp;</font></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>